name: Read a completed live investigation after an actual commit change without rescanning
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | changed-checkout
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Review | historical-review
require-live-snap: 30 FINDINGS · 1 | settled-historical-list
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public documentation example | original-decision
resize: 160x48
live-snap: revision-review-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: revision-review-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: revision-review-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: revision-review-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: revision-review-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: original-detail-page-10
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: original-detail-page-20
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: original-detail-tail
ask: Does Review preserve the original false-positive decision and source SHA while clearly disclosing that the changed checkout has not been reassessed?
resize: 120x36
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope: study live-owned-scans-20261010 | historical-report
expect: earlier source
expect: 4 committed / 11 calls
expect: 2 protected review remaining
resize: 160x48
live-snap: revision-report-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: revision-report-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: revision-report-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: revision-report-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: compact-report-start
expect: Earlier source · reassess checkout
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-report-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-report-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: compact-report-page-3
keys: End
live-snap: compact-report-tail
expect: Earlier source · reassess checkout
ask: Can an operator read the original study source, current-source limitation, frozen context and unchanged allowance at every size without inferring a fix?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_source_revision.py @TARGET @ART reading
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 30 FINDINGS · 1 | recovered-historical-review
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public documentation example | recovered-original-decision
resize: 40x12
live-snap: recovered-compact-review
resize: 120x36
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope: study live-owned-scans-20261010 | recovered-historical-report
expect: earlier source
resize: 40x12
live-snap: recovered-compact-report
expect: Earlier source · reassess checkout
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_source_revision.py @TARGET @ART recovered
ask: Does no-color restart keep the earlier source and decision visible with exactly four requests, six work attempts and three observations?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
